SCOPE AND MODEL LICENCES (IMPORTANT)

This licence covers the CODE in this repository only. It does NOT cover model
weights, generated media, or third-party tools invoked by the pipeline. Those
carry their own terms, and the differences are material:

  * Wan 2.2 (Alibaba)            Apache-2.0                 commercial use OK
  * FramePack (lllyasviel)       Apache-2.0                 unmaintained upstream
  * Kokoro-82M (hexgrad)         Apache-2.0                 commercial use OK
  * Chatterbox (Resemble AI)     MIT                        watermark in output
  * WhisperX (m-bain)            BSD-2-Clause               commercial use OK
  * ComfyUI                      GPL-3.0                    distribution obligations
  * FFmpeg                       LGPL-2.1+ / GPL-2.0+       depends on build flags
  * HunyuanVideo 1.5 (Tencent)   Tencent Community          NOT valid in EU/UK/South Korea
  * LTX-2.x (Lightricks)         LTX Community              paid licence above $10M revenue
  * F5-TTS (SWivid)              MIT code / CC-BY-NC weights  NON-COMMERCIAL
  * Fish Audio S2                Research licence           commercial licence required
  * n8n                          Sustainable Use License    source-available, not OSI
  * Nano Banana / Gemini Omni    Proprietary API terms      paid, SynthID watermark

Verify against the primary source before commercial release. registry/tools.json
records the licence, source URL and verification date for every tool the pipeline
can invoke, and `python -m scripts.video_pipeline.cli registry check` enforces that
this record does not silently rot.
